    <sys:String x:Key="About.PrivacyText">OrangeGO is a peer-to-peer LAN file transfer tool. 1. File contents are transferred directly within your local network, never via any third-party server or cloud. 2. To discover and show devices on the LAN, the app uses the local device name and IP address, only for the current session and never disclosed externally. 3. The app does not collect sensitive data such as contacts, call logs, or precise location, and has no ad tracking. 4. When checking for updates, the app contacts the update source you select (GitCode/Gitee/GitHub) to fetch version info. 5. Transfer history and thumbnail cache are stored only on this device and can be cleared anytime in Settings.</sys:String>
